NCT07509632.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

1. Patients with histopathologically confirmed rectal adenocarcinoma;
2. Clinical stage cT3-4, or cN+, or M1 advanced rectal cancer;
3. Received standardized neoadjuvant chemoradiotherapy or neoadjuvant chemotherapy;
4. Underwent total mesorectal excision (TME) after the completion of neoadjuvant therapy, with complete postoperative pathological data available.

Exclusion Criteria:

1. Previous history of other malignant tumors;
2. Incomplete clinical data;
3. Underwent emergency surgery during nCRT;
4. Complicated with systemic infection or hematological diseases.

NCT07431632.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

1. Having pectus excavatum;
2. Having signed the Informed Consent Form for the study.

Exclusion Criteria:

1. Age \< 13 years at the time of the procedure;
2. Chronic use of analgesics preoperatively;
3. Pectus carinatum, Poland syndrome, or other chest wall anomalies;
4. Previous pectus excavatum repair by any technique;
5. Previous thoracic surgery;
6. Congenital heart disease;
7. Hemorrhagic dyscrasia;
8. Major anesthetic risk factors or history of previous problems with anesthesia;
9. Pregnancy.

